    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've concluded that Dalton's death was an accident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "The medical team is taking his body back to central Wrankwood by short-haul transport. There they'll report the incident to the police.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly has double-checked all the props just in case. So let's take a little break to pull ourselves together, and we'll resume shooting in the afternoon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That soon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there a problem?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cameras and film can be replaced, but we're talking about a dead man here. We've only just wiped up the blood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How the hell did he go looking for a prop and end up with a real knife?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff B"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did someone trick that washed-up drunk of an actor into looking for a lost prop himself? Or did someone put it in his hands on purpose?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-Hey now, let's not get carried away here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, the old man was a drunk and late to the set all the time, but it's not like he had any enemies in the crew. Why would anyone go that far?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, it's just an ordinary knife. There are plenty of them lying around in the crew kitchen, in the convenience stores, even our own rooms...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe someone just mentioned it in passing to Dalton, and then he...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I'm saying is that it's suspicious, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why don't you ask Dalton yourself, Miss Detective?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Staff B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, I know you're all shocked at losing a coworker. I feel the same way. But there's something even more important we should be worrying about\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have much time left for the shoot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure you haven't forgotten that this studio plate is kept separate from the nomadic city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "While it's still controlled by the central command tower, the film crew gets direct authority over certain functions, allowing us to drive it outside of central Wrankwood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "And once the lease ends, the studio closes down, and the plate returns on its own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "But more space means more costs. According to the contract, extending the lease will result in an expensive penalty\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "Which will be reflected in all of your paychecks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the producer, it's my job to act in everyone's best interests and ensure the film crew can function.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I agree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steven"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So do I, as both the lead actress and investor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Detective here did remind me, though, that someone must indeed answer for this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prop Master?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-Yes, ma'am?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Prop Master"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was your responsibility to manage the props, and you've clearly neglected it. Even your intern was on set before you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I'm sorry, ma'am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Prop Master"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Apologies won't cut it, darling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're fired. I suggest looking for a new job before our plate gets too far from the city... And whatever you're about to say, save it. You're getting off easy and you know it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "You're in charge of the prop team now, Moira.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or you could leave with your former boss, but I trust you're smarter than that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, Steven, it's time to get your act together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "We both agree that <i>The Death of Lady Dupont</i> lacks a strong ending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were supposed to submit the final script for those scenes last week. The shooting is almost caught up with what's written.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have my hands full directing, okay? This crew doesn't exactly inspire confidence, you know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steven"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you still haven't found the inspiration?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steven"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's your own original script, darling. Your baby. It deserves the very best ending.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's my biggest concern as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, which of the Rockefeller boys kills Lady Dupont? Where? How? What are her last words?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ending will determine the quality of the whole film.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She needs a good, proper death to kickstart the revival of my career in Wrankwood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the only reason I've poured my entire fortune into this project.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...God will come find me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steven"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1835_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, in literary criticism we often say that inspiration is like a god descending upon the author, using him as a vessel to write about death and rebirth, destruction and hope...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steven"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, don't worry, I'll finish the story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Steven"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. Then you're dismissed, so get to work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
