    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#3$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Stone! Miss Stone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to talk to you about something! It's important\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what you want to say, Shelly, but now's not the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go check on Lucian. This is his first film, and his first day on set, and something this serious happens...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't have him running away on us, now can I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1834_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for whatever you're thinking... you're overthinking it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm in charge of the whole prop team?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Omigosh, congrats, Molly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, it's a shame about Dalton\u2014may he rest in peace\u2014but still, I'm happy for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been working here in Wrankwood for way longer than you, but I'm still stuck doing backgrounds, while you just got the chance of a lifetime! Life really is like a box of chocolates, huh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because you always put so much of yourself into your work. The art director isn't comfortable letting you handle more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm just a girl from the pioneer zone who's good with her hands and came here looking for a job. Can I really do this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the producer says you can, you can! She's never wrong about people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your sister will be happy, won't she? You came to Wrankwood because of her, right? You gotta tell her you've been promoted to prop master!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll call her after we clock out. Miss Stone put her trust in me, so I have to do this right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's my girl! You're already sounding the part. I bet in just a few days, you won't even have time to watch horror flicks with me anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tippi!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
