    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "62_g1_setting_lobby",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop walking in front of me, Shelly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "text": "You already checked the storyboard three times and the equipment five times. I swore to the producer that I wouldn't lose another set of cameras. Now can you stop glaring at me like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Whispers) Do you think... it was really...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that? Speak up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think Dalton's death was really just an accident? Doesn't it seem strange to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't know, don't care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've lost count of how many times I've had to work overtime because that has-been got lost in a beer keg. Good riddance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wasn't like that five years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No shit, he was at the top of the world, starring in Greta and Steven's next big thing. How could I forget that when we were both there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the weird part!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw a lot of familiar names on the staff list during the planning meetings. And when I saw your face, I got this eerie feeling, like\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like we were back five years ago, witnessing that young actress's death again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't it all seem a little... similar?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How so? One was a fall, the other was a prop mix-up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're overreacting, Shelly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm telling you, I'm not crazy... Ah, now I remember! Dalton was the one most responsible for the accident!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Judgment has come... Someone came for him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just stop already! Stop scratching your arm, and stop coming up with this nonsense! I told you: if what happened still bothers you that much, get therapy and stay away from the set.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1843_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're just ordinary joes shooting crappy movies for a living. Nobody gives a flip about us. Shelly? Do you hear me, Shelly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear it... I hear it... Something's coming... coming for us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "24_RL_castlehall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 0,
        "keep": true,
        "initamount": 0,
