        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "amount": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1841_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Picture the position and angle of the stab in your mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Near the bottom-right of the abdomen is a gap between vital organs, rich in blood supply, but not immediately lethal. You can feed off the blood of others, and let it herald the climax that is to come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or, you can move the point of the knife up and penetrate the thorax.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The lungs are fragile and offer no resistance. Your target will drown in both his own blood and your animated monologue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raise your dagger, boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1841_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think back to the segments we've rehearsed. You've done well. There's only one step to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stab! Let the point of the knife know how it feels to stir the organs and sever blood vessels, and let it listen to the sound of the heart beating!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1841_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you afraid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "text": "...How ordinary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "bstart": 0.3,
        "bend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not afraid. He just doesn't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's still not willing to practice stabbing. He hasn't spoken a single word since he took up the dagger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.3,
        "bend": 0.6,
        "focus": "l",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "200,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Go prepare for tomorrow's performance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will instruct him myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see... Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "'Whiteflower'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1841_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you find the dagger heavy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But its weight does not come from the metal, nor from the ornaments. It comes from your heart. Do you understand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The boy's hair covers his eyes. He nods in silence."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whiteflower does not realize that you've learned so quickly. You're waiting for her to provide answers she cannot give you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen to me, child...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Troupe Leader holds Lucian's little hands in his own. His smile is warm and gentle, but his iron grip permits no refusal."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian can feel his stiff fingers begin to relax."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget the techniques that Whiteflower's been trying to teach you. You have no need to imitate any form, or any method of stabbing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no dagger without blood on it, no crossbow that is not fired. Just hold them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are not props. They will tell you what to desire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let them guide you. Do not doubt them, even if they point you towards someone you never expected\u2014a friend, a lover, even yourself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps even me, standing before you now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have no hesitation. Stab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give it a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Shakes head)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Shakes head)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Try it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you, and I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "What roles are we playing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we're forgetting the techniques, then forget the characters and the script as well. They're simply the medium of theater, not theater itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian grips the knife. The Troupe Leader lets go of his hand and kneels in front of him, so that their gazes are almost level."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we're too close to each other...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you afraid you'll hurt me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's alright, child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget even that feeling.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will immerse yourself in theater, and touch upon its beauty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gazing at the Troupe Leader, Lucian finds himself overcome with doubt. Is this really the first time he has seen the man?"
    },
    {
        "text": "He does not understand what he is saying. He begins to doubt whether the Feline before him even exists at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian can feel his own heart throbbing."
    },
    {
        "text": "The heartbeat never lies. The heartbeat knows the answer."
    },
    {
        "text": "How should he ask it?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Troupe Leader smiles, encouraging him wordlessly."
    },
    {
        "text": "The answer is obvious."
    },
    {
        "text": "Without hesitation, Lucian thrusts\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$knifegore"
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_slash_02_s",
        "x": 170,
        "y": -100,
        "rox": -30,
        "roy": 89,
        "roz": 150,
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you feel it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian's hands are trembling. He feels them grow weak, almost letting go of the dagger."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Troupe Leader has not moved an inch, not even a flicker of expression."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian is certain his knife found its mark in the man's body. He heard a sound... felt the pain that should not have belonged to him, a strong, willful pain."
    },
    {
        "text": "He had been silent since he came to the Troupe. Now, though, the pain makes him want to sing."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is your first lesson. All stories leave behind only certain emotions, or...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Troupe Leader pauses. Lucian casts a questioning glance, and meets those golden eyes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1829_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A bond so tight that it cannot be broken.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Troupe Leader"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Young Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
