    {
        "text": "Lucian looks down at his hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "The blood on his gloves has been washed away, but he remembers the feeling of taking Dalton's knife out of his hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "Fascination, revelry."
    },
    {
        "text": "The complex emotions he felt when he was taught to use a dagger for the first time."
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget complicated assassination techniques. Ignite the ego with intense emotion, until all that is left is two souls tearing at one another."
    },
    {
        "text": "Let life converge upon the knife of truth and falsehood, and bestow upon the target the perfect ending\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death."
    },
